{"id":"fee1253e7ff15977","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition.md","title":"ZFC Forcing3 Countable Model Generic Condition","display":"df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition — ZFC Forcing3 Countable Model Generic Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition — ZFC Forcing3 Countable Model Generic Condition","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-dense.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition — ZFC Forcing3 Countable Model Generic Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"681e6314e26cdd0b\" href=\"?note=681e6314e26cdd0b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-dense.md\">../batch10/58-df-dense.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\theta\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\theta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HTheta}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HTheta}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\)</span> (canonical hereditary-size carrier and membership structures from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\">\\(\\prec_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\)</span> (elementary-substructure relation on those structures)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dense}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dense}\\)</span> (see the dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3CountableModelGenericCondition}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3CountableModelGenericCondition}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}countable\\text{-}model\\text{-}generic\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3CountableModelGenericCondition}_S\n(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\theta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\omega\\in\\theta\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists H_\\theta,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H_\\theta,\\theta)\n\\land M\\subseteq H_\\theta\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H_\\theta)\n\\land\\mathfrak M\\prec_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\mathfrak H\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19mm}\\land\n\\forall D\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Dense}(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\n\\forall s\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle s,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{52mm}\n\\exists r\\in D\\cap M\\;\\exists u\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n(\\langle u,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\n\\land\\langle u,r\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}countable\\text{-}model\\text{-}generic\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3CountableModelGenericCondition}_S\n(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\theta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\omega\\in\\theta\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists H_\\theta,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H_\\theta,\\theta)\n\\land M\\subseteq H_\\theta\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H_\\theta)\n\\land\\mathfrak M\\prec_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\mathfrak H\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19mm}\\land\n\\forall D\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Dense}(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\n\\forall s\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle s,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{52mm}\n\\exists r\\in D\\cap M\\;\\exists u\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n(\\langle u,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\n\\land\\langle u,r\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For every dense set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> belonging to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>, the set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\cap M\">\\(D\\cap M\\)</span> is predense below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The order argument of density and the common-extension witness for compatibility are explicit.</li>\n<li>Elementarity is now applied to the canonical membership structures, rather than to the raw carrier sets <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\theta\">\\(H_\\theta\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-dense.md","status":"resolved","id":"681e6314e26cdd0b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-dense.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-proper.md","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-proper.md","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HTheta}_S$ and $\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S$ (canonical hereditary-size carrier and membership structures from [[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\theta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HTheta}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec_{\\mathcal L_\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Countable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dense}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3CountableModelGenericCondition}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}countable\\text{-}model\\text{-}generic\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\\\\\n&\\quad\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3CountableModelGenericCondition}_S\n(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\theta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\omega\\in\\theta\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\\\\\n&\\land\\exists H_\\theta,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H_\\theta,\\theta)\n\\land M\\subseteq H_\\theta\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H_\\theta)\n\\land\\mathfrak M\\prec_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\mathfrak H\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in M\\\\\n&\\hspace{19mm}\\land\n\\forall D\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Dense}(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\n\\forall s\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle s,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\to\\\\\n&\\hspace{52mm}\n\\exists r\\in D\\cap M\\;\\exists u\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n(\\langle u,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\n\\land\\langle u,r\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"D\\cap M","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\theta","display":false}],"bytes":2564,"backlinks":[{"id":"c6aba3343ae870e5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3CountableModelGenericCondition}_S$ (countable-model genericity predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2072","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition.md|58-df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","1b3610e6aed65b25","d3f859dbdd37f018","681e6314e26cdd0b","0fbfc19800246e77","8935dcac821c0104"]}